# Required Refactoring

Where safe and appropriate:

* Replace local implementations with Platform implementations.
* Remove duplicated code.
* Consolidate imports.
* Eliminate unnecessary abstractions.
* Preserve all existing business behavior.
* Do not introduce breaking changes.

If a local implementation exists because the Platform lacks an equivalent, document it as a gap instead of forcing an incorrect migration.

